sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Emp as Employee (Receiver)
    participant Corp as Employer (Originator)
    participant ODFI as ODFI (Employer's bank)
    participant Op as ACH Operator<br/>(FedACH or EPN)
    participant Fed as Federal Reserve<br/>Master Accounts
    participant RDFI as RDFI (Employee's bank)

    Emp->>Corp: Direct deposit enrollment<br/>(PPD authorization, on file)

    Note over Corp: Day T-2, payroll run
    Corp->>Corp: Generate Nacha file<br/>File header, batch header (PPD),<br/>entry detail per employee,<br/>effective entry date = T
    Corp->>ODFI: Transmit file over SFTP/PGP

    ODFI->>ODFI: Format edits: counts, hash totals,<br/>routing check digits
    ODFI->>ODFI: Exposure check against<br/>originator's approved limit
    ODFI->>ODFI: OFAC screening

    alt File fails edits
        ODFI-->>Corp: Reject with error detail
    end

    Note over ODFI,Op: Day T-1, before 2:15 a.m. ET deadline
    ODFI->>Op: Submit forward entries

    Op->>Op: Sort all entries by<br/>destination routing number
    Op->>Op: Compute net settlement<br/>position per institution
    Op->>RDFI: Deliver inbound file

    Note over Fed: Day T, 8:30 a.m. ET settlement
    Op->>Fed: Settlement instruction
    Fed->>Fed: Debit ODFI master account<br/>Credit RDFI master account (net)
    Fed-->>Op: Settled

    RDFI->>RDFI: Post entries to accounts<br/>Credits available by 9:00 a.m. local
    RDFI->>Emp: 2,847.50 USD credited<br/>"ACME CORP PAYROLL"

    alt Account closed or invalid
        RDFI->>Op: Return entry (R02, R03, R04)<br/>within 2 banking days
        Op->>ODFI: Deliver return
        ODFI->>Corp: Return advice, funds reversed
    end

    alt Detail wrong but posted
        RDFI->>Op: Notification of Change (COR)
        Op->>ODFI: Deliver NOC
        ODFI->>Corp: Correct within 6 banking days
    end
